WEBVTT

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:30.944
really has become a very popular notion.

00:13:30.968 --> 00:13:33.536
I think we kind of reached
peak authenticity

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.167
a few years back.

00:13:35.191 --> 00:13:37.706
AG: In the past, when we
talked about authenticity,

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.023
we weren't usually describing people.

00:13:40.047 --> 00:13:42.555
HI: The original meaning
is from the world of art,

00:13:42.579 --> 00:13:44.281
that which can be authenticated,

00:13:44.305 --> 00:13:48.946
meaning, trace back to the person
who made it of their own hands.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.684
And in leadership,

00:13:50.708 --> 00:13:56.155
I think this really came out of
the number of scandals that hit,

00:13:56.179 --> 00:13:59.114
starting in the 1980s and '90s,

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:02.306
and that decline in trust in leaders.